      "titleEN": "Paranoia Agent",
      "titleJP": "妄想代理人",
      "airedLabel": "Winter 2004",
      "ratingNumber": 5,
      "ratingText": "Peak, Nice Ep Broh",
      "review": "Dammit, this is still great. It still actually looks really good, which is especially hard considering the era it was made in, which was the early digital transition — there are a lot of things from that era that end up looking pretty trashy. Fabulous opening, too. It's a great episode, a great piece of Kon's work. And it's always interesting to see someone who primarily works in one medium translate to another — in this case, a film director going and doing a 13-episode TV series. So I'm very happy that we're watching/reviewing this again, and I'm definitely looking forward to seeing where this crazy show goes, one I haven't watched in over 20 years.",
